    specialAbilities: "Calm Emotions Aura (Su) A vulpinal’s aura acts like a calm emotions\n spell with a radius of 30 feet. Any creature entering this area must make a Will save (DC 16) to resist the effect. A creature that makes its save is immune to that vulpinal’s aura for 24 hours. The save DC is Charisma-based."
