    source: "Chronicle of the Righteous pg. 61",
    specialAbilities: "Hone Senses (Su) Three times per day, a spyglass archon can\n concentrate its attention as a swift action. For a number of\n rounds equal to its Hit Dice (4 for most spyglass archons), the\n range of the spyglass archon’s darkvision is doubled, it gains\n a +6 bonus on Perception checks, and it gains blindsense out\n to a range of 15 feet."
