    environment: "any",
    treasure: "standard",
    description: "Said to be fiendish relations of all goblinoid races, the hateful barghests come to the Material Plane to feed. As they consume the bodies of innocents, they grow increasingly powerful. A barghest eventually sheds its skin to transform into a greater barghest, at which point it often seeks out a tribe of goblins or other creatures to rule.Creatures in \"Barghest\" Category\nName CR Barghest4Greater Barghest7Barghest\nThis snarling, canine beast pads forward on all fours, its slender front limbs looking more like hands than a wolf’s paws.",
    source: "Pathfinder RPG Bestiary pg. 27",
