    description: "A dimetrodon is a quadrupedal reptile similar in shape to a crocodile, but with a blunter snout filled with jagged, sharp teeth. Its most distinguishing feature is the massive sail that runs the length of its back. By extending or contracting the fin, the cold-blooded reptile can control its body temperature with ease. While they are not technically dinosaurs, dimetrodons are still often found dwelling in regions inhabited by such creatures.\n\nA fully grown adult dimetrodon can reach a length of up to 15 feet and weigh upward of 2,000 pounds.Creatures in \"Dinosaur\" Category\nName CR \nSource Pathfinder RPG Bestiary pg. 83",
